Body with newline: body 'line1\nline2' → '> **Jane Doe** (2024-01-15):\n>\n> line1\n> line2'.

Author fallback: author {emailAddress: 'j@x.com'} → '> **j@x.com** (date):'. Author absent → '**Unknown**'. Created absent → '()'.

Empty comments array (or {total:0, comments: []}) → renderCommentsMarkdown returns '' → no '**Comments:**' in output.

Plain array shape: comment = [ {author...} ] → works too.

Multiple comments: blank line between: joined with '\n' → '> ...line1\n> ...line2'.

